        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "RuneLure family. Trojanized RuneLite client. Hidden, enabled-by-default plugins aloginandpin.rswiki (RS Wikis) and abankcheck.BankWebhookPlugin (Bank Value Checker) steal Jagex session/access/refresh tokens, legacy login passwords, and bank PINs, and report account wealth, world, location, and IP. Captures typed and pasted passwords in the client login field and PIN digits from keyboard/button input. Exfiltrates JSON reports to a PHP receiver. Case-insensitive chat substring hehexdxd calls System.exit(0); hehelolxd triggers bank reporting."
